{"id":124932130,"slug":"op-med-my-annual-doximity-apa-column","title":"Op-Med: My Annual Doximity APA Column Has Arrived.","subtitle":"This year: \"The Disconnect\"","post_date":"2023-05-31T01:07:19.186Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/op-med-my-annual-doximity-apa-column","wordcount":109,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:59:10.250Z","body_sha256":"8d57b96a3dfb39eb1f9dddfb8828765136f19a0c4a9f6c1df82878d4a5b75b2c","text_words":122,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p><a href=\"https://www.doximity.com\">Doximity</a> has built a great product. And <a href=\"https://www.doximity.com/dialer?utm_campaign=marketing_dialer_video_doximity_video_20200413&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;campaignid=9997173066&amp;adgroupid=109389837308&amp;adid=434157627287&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjwvdajBhBEEiwAeMh1UxcIoh7xnvN-xijztD6e_VFcbdmWLTq2JOsLCW3--NrS1ncIzshUMRoCB-cQAvD_BwE\">doximity dialer</a> is also amazing.</p><p>They also have asked your author to write a review of the American Psychiatric Association annual meeting…with tremendous latitude.  I have done so again, in a style more in keeping with Lobster Consideration than anything else.  I’m grateful for the opportunity.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GbUO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd950f2a-3dcc-4b50-8767-2d8c76996d4a_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GbUO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd950f2a-3dcc-4b50-8767-2d8c76996d4a_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GbUO!,w_848,c_limit,f_web